      "message": "util: Add BIP322 simple proof verification\n\nAdd wallet-independent BIP322 simple proof verification for native P2WPKH,\nP2WSH and P2TR challenges. Construct the tagged message hash and virtual\ntransactions, and verify witnesses with Core's script interpreter under\nthe BIP's required and upgradeable rules.\n\nUse a local signature checker for the permitted sighash types. Distinguish\ninvalid proofs from inconclusive upgrade mechanisms, and accept current\nsmp signatures and pre-final unprefixed proofs, including witnesses whose\nBase64 text starts with a variant name. Existing legacy message routines\nretain their behavior.\n\nInclude pinned BIP322 2.1.0 test vectors with CC0 provenance, regressions for\nencoding, commitments and script rules, and structured message fuzz inputs.\nThe verification helpers provide the basis for wallet and RPC integration.",
      "committer": {
