      "message": "wallet: Sign BIP322 simple messages\n\nSign native P2WPKH, P2WSH and P2TR message challenges with the wallet's\ndescriptor data. Supply the zero-valued virtual output to the existing\ntransaction signer and request SIGHASH_ALL for each supported type.\n\nRequire a complete witness and successful BIP322 verification before\nreturning an smp proof. Preserve the caller's output on failure, including\nwhen keys or script data are unavailable or the wallet is locked.\n\nCover the published vector inputs, multisig thresholds, compound\nMiniscript and Taproot key and script paths. Add failure tests for partial\nsignatures, encryption, unsupported destinations and timelocked policies.",
