      "message": "rpc: Support BIP322 simple message signatures\n\nRoute native P2WPKH, P2WSH and P2TR message signing and verification\nthrough the BIP322 simple proof helpers. Keep legacy P2PKH behavior.\n\nAdd published-vector RPC tests, descriptor-wallet coverage and help\ndescribing the supported formats and signing limits.",
